Tool response:
Tool: add_patient_to_waitlist
Description: Registers patient Emily Chen for a cleaning appointment with any hygienist, 
preferring morning slots, and creates a notification entry for when a slot becomes available.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "patient_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Patient Id"
        },
        "appointment_type_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Appointment Type Id"
        },
        "preferred_time_of_day": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Preferred Time Of Day"
        },
        "preferred_hygienist_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Preferred Hygienist Id"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "patient_id",
        "appointment_type_id",
        "preferred_time_of_day"
      ]
    }
